WEBVTT

01:40.480 --> 01:42.320
His Majesty's edict is here!

01:58.760 --> 02:00.920
This is His Majesty's verbal orders.

02:03.440 --> 02:07.480
The cases of Jiang Li breaking a prisoner
out of jail and Xue Huaiyuan's corruption

02:07.560 --> 02:11.440
will be tried together
at the Court of Judicial Review.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.440
Duke Su is the imperial commissioner

02:13.520 --> 02:15.480
who will supervise the investigation
on His Majesty's behalf.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.720
The case will be presented
before His Majesty

02:17.800 --> 02:20.320
ten days later to judge the case.

02:21.040 --> 02:23.040
- Long live His Majesty!
- Long live His Majesty!

02:24.440 --> 02:26.000
Old Madam, don't worry.

02:26.080 --> 02:27.080
Have some pear soup.

02:35.400 --> 02:36.240
Dear,

02:37.680 --> 02:38.920
did it go well with His Majesty?

02:39.000 --> 02:40.040
What did His Majesty say?

02:40.120 --> 02:42.120
His Majesty wouldn't meet me at all.

02:42.880 --> 02:43.760
Well…

02:43.840 --> 02:45.440
What does His Majesty mean?

02:49.080 --> 02:50.880
His Majesty is making me avoid suspicions.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.800
Don't worry too much, dear.

02:52.880 --> 02:55.240
Tomorrow, I'll enter the palace
to ask Consort Li about it.

02:55.320 --> 02:58.160
I'm sorry to let you
run around because of this.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.640
What are you saying?

03:00.160 --> 03:01.800
Although I'm just a homemaker,

03:01.880 --> 03:03.480
I know what's at stake.

03:03.560 --> 03:06.160
This doesn't only concern Li'er's survival

03:06.240 --> 03:08.880
but also the Jiang family's reputation.

03:08.960 --> 03:10.760
I won't just stand by and do nothing.

03:10.840 --> 03:12.840
It's great for you to think that.

03:13.720 --> 03:17.680
It's just pitiful that Li'er is locked up
at the Court of Judicial Review.

03:18.240 --> 03:20.800
And it's also bad
for the Jiang family's reputation.

03:21.760 --> 03:23.280
I've heard some rumors

03:23.840 --> 03:25.640
even from here.

03:25.720 --> 03:28.000
They said the Jiang family's daughter
is no longer pure

03:28.640 --> 03:31.040
after being locked up.

03:31.120 --> 03:33.120
Even the Jiang family's name
can't be cleared.

03:33.200 --> 03:34.120
Mother.

03:34.200 --> 03:36.040
It's not that I don't want to save her,

03:36.120 --> 03:37.680
but she is really…

03:37.760 --> 03:38.680
Well…

03:40.680 --> 03:43.720
We are not completely helpless
in this case.

03:43.800 --> 03:45.200
What do you mean?

03:45.280 --> 03:47.720
Previously, there was a rule
at the capital's government office.

03:48.320 --> 03:49.400
If a woman commits a crime,

03:49.480 --> 03:51.560
as long as it's not killing
her husband or children,

03:51.640 --> 03:53.440
she can be

03:53.520 --> 03:55.840
supervised back home

03:55.920 --> 03:57.280
by her husband or family members

03:57.920 --> 03:59.040
and await for her summon.

03:59.600 --> 04:01.000
The Court of Judicial Review
might be great,

04:01.080 --> 04:02.880
but it's still
the capital's government office.

04:03.440 --> 04:04.880
Since Li'er is not married,

04:04.960 --> 04:07.680
the Jiang family will supervise her.

04:09.240 --> 04:10.080
Good.

04:10.840 --> 04:13.800
I'll write to the minister
of the Court of Judicial Review tomorrow.

04:13.880 --> 04:15.840
There's no need for you to write.

04:16.600 --> 04:17.760
You've worked hard and long

04:17.839 --> 04:19.839
to deal with the Dingzhou issue.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.120
It's better

04:21.200 --> 04:23.240
for the Jiang family's women
to handle this.

04:23.840 --> 04:25.400
You mean…

04:25.480 --> 04:26.640
Don't worry.

04:26.720 --> 04:28.400
I will surely bring Li'er back.

04:35.320 --> 04:37.400
COURT OF JUDICIAL REVIEW

04:52.040 --> 04:54.760
You've been reminding me
to stay calm over and over again,

04:56.840 --> 04:58.640
but I still failed to do so.

04:58.720 --> 04:59.600
I expected that,

05:00.760 --> 05:02.280
but I didn't guess you'd be so pitiful.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.200
Aren't you a particular person?

05:12.320 --> 05:13.560
Don't you find this place dirty?

05:14.960 --> 05:15.800
I'm tired,

05:16.320 --> 05:17.520
so I'll rest here a bit.

05:22.280 --> 05:24.480
I heard you were ordered
to supervise the investigation.

05:25.520 --> 05:27.280
But you haven't asked anything
about the case.

05:27.760 --> 05:29.440
Aren't you afraid
His Majesty will punish you?

05:29.520 --> 05:31.520
You've been asking me questions
since I came in.

05:32.640 --> 05:33.560
Aren't you tired?

05:39.200 --> 05:40.080
Yes.

05:43.200 --> 05:44.520
I'm quite tired.

05:44.600 --> 05:45.960
The Admonishment Drum was beaten

05:46.720 --> 05:48.200
and His Majesty will judge it himself.

05:49.760 --> 05:51.920
You are forcing them
to back you into a corner.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.240
You've tried too hard.

05:55.680 --> 05:57.160
It's not the first time.

05:59.320 --> 06:00.920
There's actually no need to do that.

06:03.320 --> 06:04.240
Duke Su,

06:05.120 --> 06:07.000
is there anyone around you
who died unjustly?

06:12.120 --> 06:13.760
Father, wake up!

06:15.000 --> 06:16.440
Father!

06:16.520 --> 06:18.240
Father!

06:19.000 --> 06:21.320
Wake up, Father!

06:23.480 --> 06:25.000
If you were given an opportunity,

06:25.920 --> 06:28.960
would you strike the Admonishment Drum
at the Chang'an Gate for them?

07:35.160 --> 07:36.160
I think you would.

07:40.400 --> 07:41.240
All right.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.080
I'm done investigating.

07:46.520 --> 07:47.400
Is that all?

07:47.480 --> 07:48.360
Yes.

07:49.400 --> 07:51.360
Haven't you said all you need to say?

07:52.840 --> 07:53.680
I'll go ahead.

07:54.160 --> 07:55.040
Get some rest.

08:32.280 --> 08:34.760
You shouldn't have come to this place.

08:35.400 --> 08:37.200
And as the wife of the Chief Secretariat,

08:37.280 --> 08:38.760
it's not right to show yourself here.

08:38.840 --> 08:40.840
Don't restrict me with these words.

08:41.760 --> 08:44.240
I've been managing the Jiang household
for more than a decade.

08:44.320 --> 08:46.880
Although I can't see most things
in the government office,

08:46.960 --> 08:48.240
I still hear about many things.

08:48.320 --> 08:49.920
Now that you have my daughter here,

08:50.000 --> 08:53.040
do you think it's unreasonable
for me to ask about her?

08:53.120 --> 08:56.640
If you just want to see the criminal,

08:56.720 --> 08:59.440
I can help you with that.

08:59.520 --> 09:02.720
However, you are here to take her away.

09:02.800 --> 09:05.800
Forgive me for not allowing that.

09:05.880 --> 09:07.960
I just want to ask you
two questions, Duke Zhou.

09:08.040 --> 09:09.000
First.

09:09.080 --> 09:11.040
As a judicial officer,

09:11.120 --> 09:14.120
do you follow the law of Great Yan?

09:14.200 --> 09:15.240
Of course.

09:15.320 --> 09:16.560
Second.

09:16.640 --> 09:17.960
When a woman commits a crime,

09:18.040 --> 09:20.440
as long as she didn't
kill her husband or children,

09:20.520 --> 09:22.040
she can be taken home

09:22.120 --> 09:24.680
to be supervised
by her husband or family members

09:24.760 --> 09:26.000
while waiting to be summoned

09:26.640 --> 09:28.080
before the trial.

09:28.160 --> 09:31.200
Is this one of the laws of Great Yan?

09:31.280 --> 09:32.120
Well…

09:33.120 --> 09:33.960
Yes.

09:34.040 --> 09:35.360
In that case,

09:35.440 --> 09:37.560
why can't I set foot in this place?

09:39.040 --> 09:40.280
I came here today

09:40.920 --> 09:43.000
because I insisted
on picking up my daughter.

09:43.080 --> 09:44.520
I want to see

09:45.480 --> 09:47.000
who dares to stop me.

09:49.160 --> 09:50.000
Guard.

09:51.440 --> 09:52.280
Yes.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.200
Bring Ms. Jiang Li here.

09:54.280 --> 09:55.120
Yes.

09:56.480 --> 09:58.040
I'll be waiting here then.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.200
- Duke Su.
- Duke Su.

10:04.440 --> 10:05.280
What's the matter?

10:05.360 --> 10:06.280
The minister asked us

10:06.360 --> 10:08.640
to hand over the criminal
for supervision by her family.

10:08.720 --> 10:10.000
We are here to take her out.

10:21.640 --> 10:23.040
Duke Zhou, she's here.

10:28.840 --> 10:29.680
Mrs. Jiang.

10:29.760 --> 10:30.800
Based on Great Yan's law,

10:30.880 --> 10:33.920
she'll be handed over
to the Jiang family for supervision.

10:34.000 --> 10:37.120
If she goes missing or is hidden,
you will be punished according to the law.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.080
Thank you, Duke Zhou.

10:45.800 --> 10:46.640
Don't move around.

10:47.560 --> 10:48.480
Just leave with me.

10:53.680 --> 10:54.720
Mother, why are you here?

10:55.280 --> 10:57.880
I don't know why you insisted
on overturning that magistrate's case

10:57.960 --> 10:59.920
after returning to Luyang,

11:00.480 --> 11:01.400
but I know

11:01.480 --> 11:02.920
your father has grown

11:03.440 --> 11:05.200
a lot of gray hair
because of what you did.

11:07.360 --> 11:09.960
You've let your father
and the Jiang family down.

11:10.680 --> 11:12.160
As your mother,

11:12.240 --> 11:13.920
I can't ignore your father

11:14.000 --> 11:15.520
and the reputation of the Jiang family.

11:16.080 --> 11:17.480
When you return to the Jiang family,

11:17.560 --> 11:18.640
you can explain

11:18.720 --> 11:20.360
to your father and Old Madam yourself.

11:20.440 --> 11:22.240
You are right, Mother.

11:39.200 --> 11:40.040
Grandmother,

11:40.840 --> 11:41.800
I have returned.

11:41.880 --> 11:43.080
It's good that you're home.

11:44.680 --> 11:45.760
Sit.

11:49.880 --> 11:52.760
Do you know why your father
doesn't want to see you?

11:52.840 --> 11:54.000
I'm sure Father

11:54.560 --> 11:56.640
was worried about me
with what happened in Dingzhou.

11:56.720 --> 11:58.480
I caused such a big trouble.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.720
I'm sure Father is angry at me.

12:00.800 --> 12:03.080
You are not related
to the magistrate from the Xue family.

12:03.640 --> 12:05.520
Why did you get yourself involved
in such a case?

12:06.200 --> 12:08.200
You even brought so many folks
back to the capital

12:08.280 --> 12:10.240
and risked your life

12:10.320 --> 12:11.680
and the future of the Jiang family.

12:11.760 --> 12:14.880
Magistrate Xue's daughter, Xue Fangfei,

12:15.760 --> 12:17.120
was my savior.

12:18.080 --> 12:20.040
When I was in Zhennv Hall,

12:20.120 --> 12:21.640
the Chief mistreated me

12:21.720 --> 12:22.840
and I almost died.

12:23.560 --> 12:25.800
It was Xue Fangfei who saved me.

12:26.640 --> 12:27.960
Something like that happened?

12:28.520 --> 12:29.600
I went to Luyang

12:30.560 --> 12:31.720
not only to visit my relatives

12:32.440 --> 12:34.080
but also to meet my savior.

12:34.160 --> 12:35.760
However, she passed away at a young age.

12:36.720 --> 12:37.760
Her father was in trouble

12:38.320 --> 12:39.760
and I couldn't just stand by.

12:41.200 --> 12:42.160
Li'er,

12:42.760 --> 12:45.560
I won't stop you
if you want to repay a debt of kindness,

12:46.600 --> 12:49.360
but did you have to do that this way?

12:52.520 --> 12:53.360
I know.

12:54.120 --> 12:55.240
I'm part of the Jiang family.

12:56.240 --> 12:58.480
Every move I make
will affect the Jiang family,

12:59.320 --> 13:01.360
so it wasn't my intention
to act recklessly.

13:01.440 --> 13:04.840
I only wanted to go to Huaixiang
to meet my savior at first.

13:05.880 --> 13:07.680
After I arrived in Huaixiang,

13:07.760 --> 13:10.800
I accidentally discovered
that the new magistrate

13:10.880 --> 13:12.040
was lawles,

13:12.120 --> 13:14.040
disregarded human lives,
and exploited people.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.080
You didn't see it.

13:16.160 --> 13:17.680
Huaixiang was a prosperous place,

13:17.760 --> 13:19.840
but it fell into a state

13:19.920 --> 13:21.720
where people dared not step out
during the day.

13:21.800 --> 13:23.320
It was very sad.

13:25.680 --> 13:26.720
Grandmother,

13:27.920 --> 13:29.360
you told me about the family rules

13:29.920 --> 13:31.200
Grandfather set.

13:32.160 --> 13:33.680
Protect justice,

13:33.760 --> 13:34.960
maintain righteousness,

13:35.040 --> 13:36.160
and not covet temporary fame.

13:36.960 --> 13:38.880
It's exactly because
I'm part of the Jiang family

13:38.960 --> 13:41.040
that I couldn't ignore

13:41.120 --> 13:42.520
the aggrieved and suffering people.

13:42.600 --> 13:44.400
I'm very happy to see

13:44.480 --> 13:45.640
that you have such integrity.

13:46.640 --> 13:49.360
However, you could have told
your father about it

13:49.440 --> 13:50.600
and let him handle it.

13:50.680 --> 13:53.200
You didn't need to put yourself
in danger again and again.

13:54.280 --> 13:55.760
I had no choice.

13:56.320 --> 13:57.520
The new Huaixiang magistrate

13:57.600 --> 13:59.040
I told you about just now

13:59.560 --> 14:00.680
colluded with the Li family.

14:01.840 --> 14:02.960
What?

14:04.360 --> 14:07.200
In the Soochow brocade incident
of the Ye family in Luyang,

14:07.280 --> 14:09.360
someone purposely placed poison
to frame the Ye family.

14:10.280 --> 14:12.800
I wrote a letter
to inform Father about that.

14:13.520 --> 14:15.280
I also found clues in Luyang.

14:16.240 --> 14:19.160
The Li family is most probably
the mastermind behind this.

14:22.520 --> 14:25.320
Are you going to overturn
the convicted official's case next?

14:26.920 --> 14:28.120
Since ancient times,

14:28.200 --> 14:30.320
there have been countless wronged cases.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.960
Only a few could be overturned.

14:33.040 --> 14:34.880
After breaking
a death row prisoner out of jail,

14:34.960 --> 14:36.160
I heard you'll be executed

14:36.640 --> 14:37.840
if you can't overturn the case.

14:37.920 --> 14:39.160
Grandmother,

14:39.240 --> 14:43.080
I've gotten Xue Huaiyuan's dossier.

14:43.840 --> 14:45.200
The case is a mess

14:45.280 --> 14:46.280
and full of flaws.

14:47.160 --> 14:49.480
Besides, if Magistrate Xue is guilty,

14:49.560 --> 14:50.880
so many people

14:50.960 --> 14:52.720
won't come with me
to petition to His Majesty.

14:52.800 --> 14:56.240
And the new magistrate,
supported by the Li family,

14:56.320 --> 14:57.600
bullied the people

14:57.680 --> 14:58.520
and was nefarious.

14:59.040 --> 15:00.720
People hate him.

15:01.680 --> 15:04.400
I'll tell your father about this.

15:04.960 --> 15:05.880
Thank you, Grandmother.

15:06.520 --> 15:07.360
What?

15:08.160 --> 15:10.760
The magistrate of Huaixiang
really works for the Li family?

15:11.640 --> 15:12.880
Exactly.

15:14.240 --> 15:16.200
Li and Jiang families
never saw eye to eye.

15:17.200 --> 15:18.040
Over the years,

15:18.520 --> 15:21.240
the Li family has been nurturing its power
in and out of the imperial court.

15:21.320 --> 15:24.360
Meanwhile, the Jiang family
is not the same as it used to be.

15:24.440 --> 15:27.520
I'm sure you know this
better than anyone else.

15:27.600 --> 15:29.840
The Li family has made their move.

15:30.440 --> 15:32.360
Are we going to turn a blind eye to it?

15:32.440 --> 15:37.200
No wonder Li Zhongnan
wrote the memorial himself this time

15:38.080 --> 15:40.240
and wants Jiang Li dead.

15:40.920 --> 15:42.400
You've finally understood.

15:42.480 --> 15:45.480
If Xue Huaiyuan's case can be overturned,

15:46.040 --> 15:48.840
it'd be a setback
for the Li family indeed.

15:48.920 --> 15:53.120
However, Li Zhongnan
will also hold a grudge against us.

15:53.200 --> 15:55.200
When he gets an opportunity in the future,

15:55.280 --> 15:57.720
he will take revenge
on the Jiang family like crazy.

15:57.800 --> 15:59.360
Even if you don't do anything,

16:00.000 --> 16:01.440
will the Li family stop hating us?

16:01.520 --> 16:03.560
They started the whole thing

16:03.640 --> 16:05.360
and they even harmed the Ye family.

16:06.440 --> 16:07.600
The Ye family

16:08.160 --> 16:09.840
is our in-laws.

16:09.920 --> 16:11.360
If we don't do anything,

16:12.080 --> 16:14.880
how will people view the Jiang family?

16:14.960 --> 16:17.840
Although Li'er acts
on her passion for righteousness alone

16:17.920 --> 16:20.800
and seems reckless
in hitting the Admonishment Drum,

16:20.880 --> 16:23.840
His Majesty said
he would judge the case himself.

16:23.920 --> 16:26.040
That means His Majesty also noticed

16:26.120 --> 16:27.920
something fishy about Xue Huaiyuan's case.

16:28.000 --> 16:30.000
Doesn't that
give us a chance to counterattack?

16:30.560 --> 16:32.800
Shuran has brought Li'er back now.

16:32.880 --> 16:35.040
We have nothing to be afraid of.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.040
At this point,

16:37.360 --> 16:38.960
we should help Li'er

16:39.040 --> 16:40.880
and give the Li family a blow.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.080
Did you miss her?

16:55.880 --> 16:56.720
What do you mean?

16:56.800 --> 16:58.200
I thought you came back late

16:58.960 --> 17:00.800
because you went
to the Court of Judicial Review

17:00.880 --> 17:02.440
to see Jiang Li,

17:02.520 --> 17:04.319
who looks the same as your late wife.

17:07.160 --> 17:08.079
Stop!

17:10.240 --> 17:12.280
You are so boring.

17:12.839 --> 17:13.960
You can't be teased at all.

17:14.760 --> 17:16.000
Help me see

17:16.079 --> 17:17.760
which outfit suits my complexion more.

17:21.599 --> 17:23.040
Help me take a look.

17:23.119 --> 17:25.560
Which outfit suits my complexion more?

17:27.760 --> 17:28.960
All bright colors suit you.

17:29.600 --> 17:30.920
Don't you prefer plain colors?

17:31.480 --> 17:32.600
That's because I'm lowly.

17:34.120 --> 17:34.960
All right.

17:35.720 --> 17:37.880
I'll choose the red outfit then.

17:38.680 --> 17:40.400
I'll wear it

17:40.960 --> 17:42.880
to meet Ms. Jiang Li.

17:48.760 --> 17:49.760
Why is Your Highness

17:50.440 --> 17:51.680
going to the trial tomorrow?

17:52.440 --> 17:54.040
To rub salt into the wound, of course.

17:56.120 --> 17:58.240
I hope you don't start a fire

17:58.320 --> 17:59.240
and burn yourself.

18:02.560 --> 18:03.480
Shen Yurong,

18:04.560 --> 18:05.960
I've tolerated you for a long time.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.360
Your Highness, please turn around.

18:08.440 --> 18:09.720
I'll help you tidy your sleeves.

18:17.000 --> 18:18.680
I've always wanted to know

18:19.560 --> 18:21.000
that if given another chance,

18:22.720 --> 18:25.080
would you bury Xue Fangfei

18:25.680 --> 18:26.560
or kill me?

18:29.360 --> 18:30.200
I'd rather

18:31.240 --> 18:32.840
die in Your Highness' hands.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.520
TAIJI HALL

18:50.520 --> 18:51.440
Ms. Jiang Li.

18:58.800 --> 19:01.240
Why isn't Jiang Yuanbai here with you?

19:01.800 --> 19:04.920
I think you've gotten used to the prison
in the Court of Judicial Review.

19:05.000 --> 19:07.360
You've become brave now.

19:07.440 --> 19:09.560
You must be Chancellor Li.

19:10.320 --> 19:11.360
Thank you for your concern.

19:11.440 --> 19:13.200
I've already been released
from the prison.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.520
The Chief Secretariat
has always been discreet.

19:16.600 --> 19:18.560
I didn't expect his daughter

19:18.640 --> 19:19.680
to be courageous.

19:19.760 --> 19:22.280
Now that you've become more capable,

19:22.360 --> 19:23.880
it's really surprising.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.280
I'm flattered, Chancellor Li.

19:25.840 --> 19:28.960
It seems like you're confident.

19:29.040 --> 19:30.480
Are you sure they'll reveal

19:30.560 --> 19:31.640
my involvement today,

19:31.720 --> 19:33.440
so you don't feel scared at all?

19:33.960 --> 19:35.240
What are you thinking?

19:35.320 --> 19:37.480
Are you thinking how I know about this?

19:37.560 --> 19:38.800
Let me tell you this,

19:38.880 --> 19:39.720
Ms. Jiang Li.

19:40.680 --> 19:42.360
There's nothing in this world

19:42.440 --> 19:44.240
that I don't know of.

19:45.120 --> 19:46.440
You are too naive

19:46.520 --> 19:47.920
if you plan to play tricks

19:48.000 --> 19:49.520
in front of me.

19:49.600 --> 19:51.000
Even your father dares not do that,

19:51.080 --> 19:52.760
but a young girl like you

19:53.440 --> 19:55.280
is so discontented.

19:55.360 --> 19:56.200
Are you not afraid

19:56.280 --> 19:58.520
that you might die
without a grave to your name in the end?

19:58.600 --> 20:02.000
Are you reminding me to leave a way out
for a surrounded enemy

20:02.760 --> 20:04.280
and not press too hard?

20:04.760 --> 20:06.960
Ms. Jiang Li, you are really brave.

20:07.040 --> 20:08.960
You are so much better

20:09.040 --> 20:10.480
than the two incapable sons of mine.

20:11.280 --> 20:13.800
I just wonder how long
you can keep your bravery up.

20:14.360 --> 20:16.080
After today's ruling by His Majesty

20:16.160 --> 20:17.600
and there's no room for maneuver,

20:17.680 --> 20:21.440
I'm afraid Jiang Yuanbai
will have no choice but to abandon you.

20:21.520 --> 20:22.360
Chancellor Li.

20:24.760 --> 20:26.520
Duke Su, you are early as well.

20:27.440 --> 20:28.720
I was standing far away

20:28.800 --> 20:29.960
and couldn't hear you clearly.

20:30.040 --> 20:32.520
What were you saying
to educate Ms. Jiang Li?

20:33.120 --> 20:35.800
She even mentioned leaving a way out
for a surrounded enemy.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.520
I was rude.

20:38.040 --> 20:39.040
Ms. Jiang Li,

20:39.600 --> 20:41.480
what you said comes from The Art of War.

20:41.560 --> 20:42.680
It's aggressive.

20:42.760 --> 20:46.760
If you meet an old official
like Chancellor Li in the future,

20:47.320 --> 20:48.520
you must speak cautiously.

20:49.360 --> 20:50.440
Understood.

20:51.120 --> 20:53.880
Duke Su, you sure take good care of her.

20:53.960 --> 20:54.800
Not really.

20:55.840 --> 20:57.240
I'm just better

20:57.320 --> 20:59.920
at teaching others than you,
Chancellor Li.

21:02.560 --> 21:05.480
We still don't know
the results of today's trial.

21:06.120 --> 21:08.320
Ms. Jiang Li is confident now.

21:09.080 --> 21:11.120
I hope she can still smile

21:11.200 --> 21:13.440
like she does now when the trial ends.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.400
If you will excuse me.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.760
Duke Su, thank you
for helping me get off the hook again.

21:28.840 --> 21:30.480
That was not a hook

21:30.560 --> 21:31.440
for you.

21:32.000 --> 21:33.240
You can't say that.

21:33.800 --> 21:34.920
At least I can see

21:35.440 --> 21:37.040
that Li Zhongnan came prepared.

21:37.760 --> 21:39.080
In that case,

21:39.160 --> 21:41.760
I have to tell you something in advance.

21:53.880 --> 21:54.760
Relax.

21:55.520 --> 21:56.680
I'm not planning

21:56.760 --> 21:58.840
to hand my pawn over to the opponent yet.

22:02.320 --> 22:04.120
If that's the case,

22:05.440 --> 22:07.200
I must offer my gift
to express my gratitude.

22:09.880 --> 22:11.240
I've been trapped at home recently.

22:11.880 --> 22:14.440
The handkerchief
you asked me to sew is done.

22:22.040 --> 22:23.760
You have great embroidery skills.

22:23.840 --> 22:27.680
My embroidery skills cannot be compared
to the one who sews your handkerchief.

22:28.760 --> 22:30.640
I didn't even dare sew it at first,

22:31.400 --> 22:33.040
fearing I'd ruin the work of the deceased.

22:33.600 --> 22:35.360
You studied my background.

22:35.440 --> 22:39.200
Duke Su, your father, General Xiao,
was a famous general of our nation.

22:40.200 --> 22:41.600
He was a soldier his whole life.

22:41.680 --> 22:42.920
The whole nation knows that.

22:43.840 --> 22:45.680
He and Madam Yu were deeply in love.

22:46.440 --> 22:49.200
She was also an admirable
and respectable woman.

22:49.280 --> 22:50.520
What about your father?

22:51.000 --> 22:52.320
What about me?

22:55.040 --> 22:56.000
Chancellor Jiang.

22:57.240 --> 22:59.560
Chancellor Jiang, you think thoroughly

22:59.640 --> 23:00.800
and love the people.

23:02.000 --> 23:04.240
I have something to say to my daughter.

23:09.120 --> 23:10.000
Father.

23:15.720 --> 23:16.800
You've suffered.

23:16.880 --> 23:20.080
I thought you would never forgive me.

23:20.160 --> 23:22.040
You are my daughter after all.

23:22.840 --> 23:25.720
Your grandmother told me your sentiments.

23:25.800 --> 23:28.000
Don't be scared later.

23:28.080 --> 23:29.520
Just say anything on your mind.

23:30.280 --> 23:32.200
I have your back.

23:34.120 --> 23:35.000
Thank you, Father.

23:36.680 --> 23:39.600
His Majesty is here!

23:44.440 --> 23:47.640
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

23:53.320 --> 23:54.960
Rise, everyone.

23:55.040 --> 23:56.960
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

24:09.120 --> 24:12.680
The corruption case
of Huaixiang's magistrate, Xue Huaiyuan,

24:12.760 --> 24:15.040
was judged by the local government office

24:15.120 --> 24:17.120
and the dossier was handed
to the Ministry of Justice

24:17.200 --> 24:18.360
for closure.

24:19.000 --> 24:23.360
Now, the people of Huaixiang
doubt the result of the case

24:23.440 --> 24:24.800
and appeal for him

24:24.880 --> 24:27.440
and His Majesty cares
for the people, so he ordered

24:27.520 --> 24:31.320
the Ministry of Justice to hand it back
to the Court of Judicial Review.

24:31.800 --> 24:34.000
The Court of Judicial Review's minister
will handle the case

24:34.080 --> 24:35.520
and retry it together

24:35.600 --> 24:37.120
with the Ministry of Justice.

24:37.200 --> 24:39.000
The trial today

24:39.080 --> 24:42.000
will be supervised by His Majesty himself.

24:42.080 --> 24:42.920
Minister Zhou.

24:44.000 --> 24:46.600
- You may begin.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

24:48.600 --> 24:50.400
Summon Ms. Jiang Li.

24:50.960 --> 24:53.360
Summon Ms. Jiang Li!

24:54.200 --> 24:56.440
Summon Ms. Jiang Li!

25:11.760 --> 25:14.120
I, Jiang Li, greet Your Majesty.

25:14.800 --> 25:15.840
Rise and speak.

25:15.920 --> 25:17.080
Yes, Your Majesty.

25:18.640 --> 25:19.480
Ms. Jiang Li,

25:20.200 --> 25:22.280
did you bring the people of Huaixiang
into the capital

25:22.360 --> 25:24.000
for the sake

25:24.080 --> 25:27.960
of the corruption case of Xue Huaiyuan,
the magistrate of Huaixiang?

25:28.040 --> 25:29.240
Minister Zhou,

25:29.320 --> 25:30.360
half a year ago,

25:31.280 --> 25:32.760
Huaixiang's magistrate, Xue Huaiyuan,

25:33.280 --> 25:35.800
was accused of embezzlement
by a local government office officer,

25:36.360 --> 25:37.720
Feng Yutang.

25:37.800 --> 25:39.600
He was judged to be executed
by the Ministry of Justice

25:39.680 --> 25:40.520
and awaited execution in prison.

25:40.600 --> 25:42.880
I went to Huaixiang to visit a friend

25:43.640 --> 25:45.800
and accidentally discovered
something fishy in this case.

25:46.360 --> 25:47.800
According to my understanding,

25:47.880 --> 25:49.000
all of you

25:49.080 --> 25:51.200
barged into Huaixiang's government office

25:51.280 --> 25:53.240
on the day of Xue Huaiyuan's execution

25:53.320 --> 25:54.880
and took the prisoner away forcefully.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.560
Do you admit that?

25:57.120 --> 25:58.040
I do.

25:58.120 --> 25:59.160
Then do you know

25:59.240 --> 26:02.320
that breaking a prisoner out of jail from
a government office is a serious crime?

26:02.400 --> 26:03.360
I do.

26:04.360 --> 26:05.680
It was a last resort.

26:07.040 --> 26:08.240
But if we hadn't done that,

26:09.760 --> 26:13.120
Xue Huaiyuan's grievance
and the suffering of Huaixiang's people

26:13.600 --> 26:14.920
would never be known.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.960
I will take responsibility
for the crime I committed.

26:18.760 --> 26:20.720
But I hope Your Majesty and everyone here

26:21.560 --> 26:25.880
can redress the injustice
for Magistrate Xue before convicting me.

26:25.960 --> 26:27.000
Who was in charge

26:27.080 --> 26:29.080
of Xue Huaiyuan's case
at the Ministry of Justice?

26:31.880 --> 26:33.520
I was.

26:33.600 --> 26:34.880
I remember

26:35.360 --> 26:38.360
that the dossier of this case
was not complicated.

26:38.440 --> 26:41.360
Ten crates of silver were found
in Xue Huaiyuan's residence,

26:41.440 --> 26:43.960
totaling 5,000 taels,
as well as a private ledger.

26:44.760 --> 26:47.880
Along with the testimony of the local
government office officer, Feng Yutang,

26:47.960 --> 26:50.720
we both had evidence and a witness.

26:50.800 --> 26:54.920
There was nothing fishy,
as Ms. Jiang Li mentioned.

26:56.280 --> 26:59.080
Ms. Jiang Li went to Huaixiang personally.

26:59.160 --> 27:02.320
I think she has discovered
something unknown to others.

27:02.400 --> 27:04.680
Since you are trying
to overturn the case for a criminal,

27:04.760 --> 27:08.440
please present new evidence
in front of His Majesty

27:09.000 --> 27:10.440
and let us judge it.

27:12.760 --> 27:13.880
I have no new evidence.

27:13.960 --> 27:15.080
How dare you?

27:16.520 --> 27:18.120
Since you have no new evidence,

27:18.200 --> 27:19.360
how dare you trick people

27:19.440 --> 27:21.640
into coming to the capital
to sound the Admonishment Drum

27:21.720 --> 27:23.120
and force His Majesty to retry the case?

27:23.760 --> 27:24.760
Ms. Jiang Li,

27:25.280 --> 27:27.640
you have no respect
for His Majesty at all.

27:27.720 --> 27:30.080
My daughter is not done talking yet.

27:30.720 --> 27:31.680
What's the rush?

27:33.640 --> 27:35.200
Since I can't present new evidence,

27:36.640 --> 27:37.880
I will change my request.

27:38.520 --> 27:39.480
Your Majesty,

27:39.560 --> 27:40.760
I came all the way

27:40.840 --> 27:43.360
with the people of Huaixiang
to sound the Admonishment Drum,

27:43.440 --> 27:45.120
not to help Xue Huaiyuan get acquitted

27:45.200 --> 27:47.480
but to ask Your Majesty to convict him.

27:51.720 --> 27:53.160
Silence!

27:54.200 --> 27:55.240
Convict him?

27:55.920 --> 27:57.120
What do you mean?

27:57.200 --> 27:58.480
As you all know,

27:58.560 --> 28:02.120
there's concrete evidence
for the embezzlement

28:02.200 --> 28:03.760
of Huaixiang's magistrate, Xue Huaiyuan.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.640
He's a vermin of the imperial court.

28:05.720 --> 28:07.680
Your Majesty prioritizes integrity.

28:07.760 --> 28:09.280
How dare a mere magistrate of Huaixiang

28:09.360 --> 28:10.880
be so daring?

28:10.960 --> 28:13.280
Imprisonment and execution
cannot appease angry people.

28:13.360 --> 28:14.320
I think

28:14.880 --> 28:17.480
he should be punished
with death by a thousand slashes.

28:18.960 --> 28:21.360
Didn't she say
she was going to overturn the case?

28:22.080 --> 28:23.440
Is she admitting defeat

28:23.520 --> 28:24.760
because she has no evidence?

28:25.760 --> 28:28.600
Xue Huaiyuan might have a lowly position,

28:28.680 --> 28:31.200
but he was still an official of Great Yan.

28:31.280 --> 28:33.040
He was an official
in Huaixiang for a decade

28:33.120 --> 28:35.040
and they only discovered
his corruption last year

28:35.600 --> 28:37.160
and the evidence was a mere 5,000 taels.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.120
Ten years,

28:38.600 --> 28:39.440
5,000 taels.

28:39.920 --> 28:41.080
I don't think the number is right.

28:41.160 --> 28:42.800
How is it wrong?

28:42.880 --> 28:43.840
For ten years,

28:43.920 --> 28:46.240
has he been an official with integrity

28:46.320 --> 28:49.160
or has he hidden himself too well?

28:49.240 --> 28:51.120
Perhaps he was working with someone else

28:51.200 --> 28:52.440
to transport the stolen money.

28:52.520 --> 28:55.160
The last 5,000 taels left
was only the leftover amount.

28:56.160 --> 28:58.320
Where's the other stolen money?

28:58.880 --> 29:00.440
The Ministry of Justice didn't investigate

29:00.520 --> 29:01.760
and it wasn't included in the dossier.

29:02.400 --> 29:05.040
Perhaps he used the money
to purchase soldiers and horses.

29:05.120 --> 29:07.880
Then he should be suspected of treason.

29:08.560 --> 29:10.960
The Court of Judicial Review's minister
wants to kill him without investigation.

29:11.040 --> 29:12.360
If you think carefully,

29:12.440 --> 29:13.320
aren't you worried?

29:14.800 --> 29:16.400
We must investigate it in detail.

29:16.480 --> 29:18.360
However, we have no new evidence

29:18.440 --> 29:19.600
to reopen this case.

29:20.120 --> 29:21.160
What should we do?

29:21.240 --> 29:22.520
That is why

29:23.320 --> 29:25.440
I brought the people of Huaixiang
to the capital.

29:26.360 --> 29:27.720
I'd like to summon witnesses.

29:27.800 --> 29:28.960
Approved.

29:29.520 --> 29:30.440
Summon the witnesses.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.120
Kneel!

29:46.440 --> 29:48.960
Regarding Magistrate Xue Huaiyuan's
corruption case,

29:49.040 --> 29:50.440
what do you have to say?

29:51.280 --> 29:52.480
Your Majesty,

29:52.560 --> 29:55.600
I don't know
about Magistrate Xue's corruption case.

29:55.680 --> 29:57.520
I only know…

29:57.600 --> 29:58.880
Raise your head and speak.

30:03.600 --> 30:07.560
I only know that both my daughter
and I would be bullied

30:07.640 --> 30:10.080
and have nowhere to live

30:10.160 --> 30:11.400
if it wasn't for Magistrate Xue.

30:12.000 --> 30:13.560
After my husband died,

30:13.640 --> 30:15.160
- I raised my child alone.
- Mother.

30:15.840 --> 30:17.640
- At our most difficult time,
- Don't be afraid.

30:17.720 --> 30:18.680
Magistrate Xue

30:18.760 --> 30:20.960
used his own salary to subsidize us.

30:21.440 --> 30:22.280
He Jun,

30:22.760 --> 30:23.600
help them clean up.

30:24.440 --> 30:27.080
If someone dares bully them,
punish them according to the law.

30:27.160 --> 30:28.640
- Yes.
- Ping'an.

30:29.200 --> 30:30.760
Go and thank Magistrate Xue. Hurry.

30:31.760 --> 30:33.600
- Thank you, Mr. Xue.
- All right.

30:34.240 --> 30:36.640
It's fine now.
No one would dare to bully you again.

30:39.360 --> 30:40.840
If Magistrate Xue hadn't sponsored me,

30:41.400 --> 30:43.840
I might still be illiterate.

30:44.440 --> 30:46.720
My family was poor
and I couldn't afford tuition.

30:47.360 --> 30:49.520
Magistrate Xue generously
gave me travel expenses

30:50.080 --> 30:51.840
so I could return to the academy

30:51.920 --> 30:52.840
and become a scholar.

30:52.920 --> 30:53.760
Gu Da.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.440
Give him money to study.

30:55.960 --> 30:57.200
Get the money from my salary.

30:58.040 --> 30:58.880
- Yes.
- Mother.

30:58.960 --> 31:00.520
- My son.
- I can study again.

31:00.600 --> 31:02.080
Yes. That's great.

31:03.720 --> 31:05.760
They said the pork I sold

31:05.840 --> 31:06.760
would cause death.

31:06.840 --> 31:08.600
If it wasn't for Magistrate Xue,

31:08.680 --> 31:10.840
my ancestors' assets
would've been taken by the bullies.

31:12.240 --> 31:13.160
Stop!

31:14.840 --> 31:16.360
I wanted to pay Magistrate Xue,

31:16.440 --> 31:17.480
but he refused.

31:18.160 --> 31:19.000
Your Majesty,

31:19.080 --> 31:20.040
please investigate.

31:20.120 --> 31:23.440
Magistrate Xue
will never commit corruption.

31:23.520 --> 31:25.040
Magistrate Xue is a good person.

31:25.120 --> 31:26.000
- Yes.
- Yes.

31:26.080 --> 31:29.320
- Magistrate Xue is a good person.
- Magistrate Xue is a good person.

31:29.400 --> 31:31.000
- He's a good man.
- He wouldn't do that.

31:31.080 --> 31:32.000
Yes!

31:32.480 --> 31:34.360
That's what they say.

31:34.440 --> 31:36.200
Paying them

31:36.280 --> 31:40.160
to speak for the corrupt official

31:40.720 --> 31:42.000
isn't that hard either.

31:42.920 --> 31:43.880
Duke Zhou,

31:43.960 --> 31:45.880
you need to be careful.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.840
The Vice Minister of Justice is right.

31:47.920 --> 31:49.360
Why would a corrupt official

31:49.440 --> 31:51.800
do so much for the people?

31:51.880 --> 31:54.560
I'm sure these people were bribed

31:54.640 --> 31:55.680
and spoke nonsense.

31:56.240 --> 31:58.520
Please summon other witnesses.

31:59.320 --> 32:00.240
Summon the witnesses.

32:09.240 --> 32:10.080
Kneel!

32:12.280 --> 32:14.280
Magistrate Xue paved
my home entrance's road.

32:14.360 --> 32:15.560
There was a flood

32:15.640 --> 32:17.800
and Magistrate Xue
did not return home for three days.

32:17.880 --> 32:20.240
Magistrate Xue gave me money
to treat my illness.

32:20.320 --> 32:22.000
Magistrate's Xue's grace…

32:22.080 --> 32:24.760
- Magistrate Xue's kindness…
- If it wasn't for Magistrate Xue…

32:24.840 --> 32:27.080
Your Majesty, please investigate clearly!

32:27.160 --> 32:30.240
- Your Majesty, please investigate clearly!
- Your Majesty, please investigate clearly!

32:33.520 --> 32:36.920
What they said sounds touching.

32:38.280 --> 32:39.600
They remind me

32:39.680 --> 32:42.440
of the corruption case three years ago
by the magistrate of Qingzhou.

32:42.520 --> 32:45.360
The magistrate embezzled
a huge amount of money back then

32:45.440 --> 32:47.640
but used a small amount
to help the people.

32:48.440 --> 32:49.760
When we seized his assets,

32:49.840 --> 32:51.400
there were also many people

32:51.480 --> 32:52.840
who knelt and pleaded

32:52.920 --> 32:54.480
for him like them.

32:54.560 --> 32:57.520
You personally handled the case,
Minister Zhou.

32:57.600 --> 32:58.600
Have you forgotten?

32:58.680 --> 32:59.760
I still remember it well.

33:00.360 --> 33:01.840
Chancellor Li, you are right.

33:02.400 --> 33:04.360
Spending a small amount on the people

33:04.440 --> 33:06.600
and a big amount on buying lands, right?

33:07.160 --> 33:09.600
The Great Yan does have
such a greedy official.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.880
Feng Yutang is one of them.

33:12.760 --> 33:15.600
Half a year after Feng Yutang
became the magistrate of Huaixiang,

33:16.120 --> 33:18.000
he bought furniture for himself.

33:18.080 --> 33:19.520
His family wore a lot of jewelry

33:19.600 --> 33:21.200
and they lived a lavish lifestyle.

33:21.280 --> 33:23.760
Xue Huaiyuan worked there for ten years.

33:24.720 --> 33:26.240
I'm sure he had more assets than him.

33:26.320 --> 33:28.480
Half a year ago,
Xue Huaiyuan was imprisoned

33:28.560 --> 33:29.960
and his assets were seized.

33:30.040 --> 33:32.120
I request the Grand Censor

33:32.200 --> 33:34.360
to announce the assets seized
from the Xue family

33:34.440 --> 33:35.360
and the Feng family.

33:35.440 --> 33:36.960
Show everyone

33:37.040 --> 33:38.520
how much worse

33:38.600 --> 33:40.840
Xue Huaiyuan is compared to Feng Yutang.

33:40.920 --> 33:44.240
Grand Censor, please present
the two magistrates' assets.

33:48.480 --> 33:50.960
The former magistrate of Huaixiang,
Xue Huaiyuan,

33:51.040 --> 33:53.320
had no houses or lands

33:53.400 --> 33:54.600
when he was in office.

33:54.680 --> 33:56.680
The amount of stolen money
seized from his residence

33:57.320 --> 34:00.800
and his total assets
amount to a total of 5,000 taels.

34:01.360 --> 34:03.280
- That…
- That's not right.

34:04.200 --> 34:06.800
The current magistrate of Huaixiang,
Feng Yutang,

34:07.360 --> 34:10.960
has more than 40 houses
while he is in office.

34:11.040 --> 34:14.320
The farmland he owns is too much to count.

34:15.159 --> 34:18.360
After investigation,
his houses, farmlands, and savings

34:18.440 --> 34:21.040
exceeded a total of 200,000 tales.

34:21.120 --> 34:22.560
What? Over 200,000 taels?

34:23.239 --> 34:24.679
He has more than 200,000 taels?

34:26.600 --> 34:28.480
A complicated 200,000 taels

34:29.040 --> 34:30.679
and a clean 5,000 taels.

34:31.239 --> 34:32.120
In that case,

34:33.280 --> 34:34.840
Magistrate Xue didn't even leave himself

34:34.920 --> 34:37.000
a piece of roof tile in Huaixiang.

34:37.560 --> 34:39.600
He only embezzled 5,000 taels.

34:40.159 --> 34:42.560
And the money
was all exchanged into ingots

34:42.639 --> 34:43.639
and put into crates

34:43.719 --> 34:46.239
in his own residence, waiting
for the Ministry of Justice's seizure.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.320
He is indeed an example

34:48.400 --> 34:50.280
for corrupt officials.

34:50.360 --> 34:51.600
Stop using your eloquent words.

34:53.000 --> 34:54.199
No matter how much

34:54.280 --> 34:56.000
and how he got the money,

34:56.080 --> 34:57.520
he is still corrupt.

34:57.600 --> 35:01.120
Minister Zhou,
please summon other witnesses.

35:01.200 --> 35:02.240
Summon the witnesses.

35:33.320 --> 35:34.160
Your Majesty,

35:34.240 --> 35:36.680
we were officers of Huaixiang
when Magistrate Xue was in office.

35:36.760 --> 35:39.640
Magistrate Xue stayed in Huaixiang
for ten years.

35:40.280 --> 35:41.600
He was never corrupt.

35:41.680 --> 35:43.200
After he was imprisoned,

35:43.280 --> 35:45.480
all of us who knew the truth
were confined in a mine.

35:46.760 --> 35:47.680
Your Majesty!

35:47.760 --> 35:49.160
We are willing to swear on our lives.

35:49.240 --> 35:51.920
If we tell a lie, punish us

35:52.440 --> 35:53.880
by nine familial exterminations.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.600
We are willing to swear on our lives.

35:55.680 --> 35:57.440
If we tell a lie, punish us

35:57.520 --> 35:58.840
by nine familial exterminations!

35:58.920 --> 36:00.360
We are willing to swear on our lives.

36:00.440 --> 36:01.960
If we tell a lie, punish us

36:02.040 --> 36:03.440
by nine familial exterminations.

36:03.520 --> 36:05.040
We are willing to swear on our lives.

36:05.120 --> 36:06.680
If we tell a lie, punish us

36:06.760 --> 36:08.240
by nine familial exterminations!

36:08.320 --> 36:09.800
- We are willing to swear on our lives.
- We are willing to swear on our lives.

36:09.880 --> 36:11.080
- If we tell a lie, punish us
- If we tell a lie, punish us

36:11.160 --> 36:12.600
- by nine familial exterminations.
- by nine familial exterminations.

36:22.200 --> 36:23.200
No matter what,

36:23.280 --> 36:25.640
it is true that Xue Huaiyuan was corrupt.

36:25.720 --> 36:27.560
As Ms. Jiang Li mentioned,

36:27.640 --> 36:31.000
he should be punished
with death by a thousand slashes.

36:31.080 --> 36:31.920
Hold it.

36:33.520 --> 36:34.400
Jiang Li,

36:35.360 --> 36:36.200
go on.

36:36.960 --> 36:39.280
The magistrate of Huaixiang,
Xue Huaiyuan, committed a crime.

36:40.040 --> 36:42.000
His crime is that in the ten years
he was in the position,

36:42.080 --> 36:44.160
apart from embezzling
the disaster relief funds,

36:44.760 --> 36:45.880
he had almost no desires

36:46.480 --> 36:47.760
and was loyal,

36:48.440 --> 36:49.880
responsible,

36:50.400 --> 36:51.920
and upright.

36:52.760 --> 36:54.360
It's hard to find
a corrupt official like him.

36:54.440 --> 36:56.000
So during his term,

36:56.080 --> 36:58.800
he must have had many schemes
and evil actions.

36:59.640 --> 37:00.680
During his term,

37:00.760 --> 37:02.160
where did his money go?

37:02.640 --> 37:06.920
Building dams and footpaths
and benefiting the people.

37:07.000 --> 37:09.640
He was trying to embarrass

37:09.720 --> 37:12.000
the good officials in the capital
who live a lavish life

37:12.080 --> 37:13.720
and own hectares of land.

37:13.800 --> 37:16.720
He was shameless and arrogant!

37:16.800 --> 37:20.240
Xue Huaiyuan's crime
is unforgivable indeed.

37:22.280 --> 37:23.640
I request Your Majesty

37:24.360 --> 37:27.120
to punish Xue Huaiyuan
with death by a thousand slashes.

37:31.000 --> 37:32.240
In that case,

37:32.320 --> 37:34.560
Xue Huaiyuan did not commit a crime

37:34.640 --> 37:35.760
but had merits instead.

37:35.840 --> 37:37.480
I request

37:38.240 --> 37:40.720
that Xue Huaiyuan be brought to the hall.

37:41.280 --> 37:43.240
Xue Huaiyuan is a witness as well.

37:43.320 --> 37:44.760
I want Your Majesty

37:45.320 --> 37:47.120
to see what Magistrate Xue looks like now.

37:47.760 --> 37:48.680
Approved.

37:48.760 --> 37:50.280
Summon Xue Huaiyuan.

38:12.320 --> 38:13.280
Your Majesty,

38:13.360 --> 38:15.640
this man is Xue Huaiyuan,
the magistrate of Huaixiang.

38:16.680 --> 38:18.400
He was imprisoned by Feng Yutang

38:18.480 --> 38:19.640
and was heavily tortured.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.600
He is now mentally confused

38:21.680 --> 38:22.680
and behaves like a child.

38:23.640 --> 38:25.680
What a pity that an upright official

38:25.760 --> 38:27.480
ended up like this.

38:28.240 --> 38:29.800
If news of this spreads,

38:29.880 --> 38:33.360
how many upright officials
in the nation will feel disappointed?

38:33.440 --> 38:35.040
And how many people

38:35.120 --> 38:37.960
will swear loyalty to Your Majesty?

38:38.040 --> 38:39.000
How dare you, Jiang Li!

38:39.480 --> 38:40.680
How dare you doubt His Majesty?

38:40.760 --> 38:42.200
Ms. Jiang Li's sentiment

38:42.280 --> 38:44.280
is coincidentally similar to mine.

38:44.360 --> 38:47.160
Sincere advice
may be unpleasant to the ear.

38:48.000 --> 38:50.400
Ms. Jiang Li's words might be out of line,

38:50.480 --> 38:52.360
but they sound reasonable.

38:52.920 --> 38:54.800
If we abandon upright officials

38:54.880 --> 38:56.160
and only use corrupt officials,

38:56.240 --> 38:57.760
the nation will be in ruins.

38:57.840 --> 38:59.560
Duke Su is right.

38:59.640 --> 39:01.760
I'm not someone
who can't take sincere advice.

39:01.840 --> 39:02.840
Minister Jiang,

39:02.920 --> 39:04.280
you raised your daughter well.

39:12.600 --> 39:14.880
Such an upright official
who loves the people

39:14.960 --> 39:16.840
was falsely accused and sent to prison.

39:16.920 --> 39:18.440
Now, he is in such a pitiful state.

39:19.520 --> 39:20.760
This is my fault

39:21.440 --> 39:23.280
and a loss for Great Yan!

39:26.160 --> 39:28.080
- We are to blame.
- We are to blame.

39:31.880 --> 39:32.840
Rise.

39:35.680 --> 39:36.600
Wei Qian!

39:38.040 --> 39:39.760
You misjudged a case.
Do you admit your guilt?

39:40.320 --> 39:42.200
I deserve to die!

39:42.280 --> 39:44.360
I didn't know

39:44.440 --> 39:47.280
there was such a nefarious person
in my administration

39:47.360 --> 39:48.520
like Feng Yutang.

39:49.400 --> 39:52.520
Zhou Dezhao, I order you to reinvestigate
Xue Huaiyuan's corruption case.

39:52.600 --> 39:54.960
Those who were involved
in framing Xue Huaiyuan

39:55.880 --> 39:56.960
should be punished severely!

39:57.040 --> 39:58.400
Yes, Your Majesty.

40:03.040 --> 40:04.120
Jiang Li,

40:04.200 --> 40:05.560
you are brave and wise.

40:05.640 --> 40:07.480
You impressed me once again.

40:08.240 --> 40:09.320
Thank you, Your Majesty.

40:12.760 --> 40:14.160
You may rise.

40:16.240 --> 40:18.520
Xue Huaiyuan's case
has been investigated clearly.

40:18.600 --> 40:20.360
Mr. Zhou, you should judge
Ms. Jiang Li's case

40:20.880 --> 40:22.280
of breaking a prisoner out of jail.

40:22.360 --> 40:23.280
Your Majesty.

40:25.360 --> 40:28.000
My daughter is reckless indeed.

40:28.080 --> 40:29.920
But after hearing the truth

40:30.000 --> 40:32.640
about Xue Huaiyuan's case earlier,

40:32.720 --> 40:37.280
I'm really reluctant to punish her
for what she did that day.

40:37.360 --> 40:39.160
A good official's unjust death

40:39.720 --> 40:42.280
is not just a tragedy to himself

40:42.360 --> 40:45.040
but a hit to every official's loyalty.

40:45.120 --> 40:48.200
My daughter made a grave mistake,

40:48.280 --> 40:52.320
but she saved a good official
whom I couldn't save.

40:53.200 --> 40:55.600
In this main hall today,

40:55.680 --> 40:56.640
I…

40:57.480 --> 40:59.840
I feel ashamed.

41:02.400 --> 41:03.400
We are ashamed!

41:07.080 --> 41:08.400
We are ashamed!

41:09.040 --> 41:11.040
- We are ashamed!
- We are ashamed!

41:11.840 --> 41:13.200
We are ashamed!

41:14.560 --> 41:16.240
We are ashamed!

41:16.320 --> 41:18.240
- We are ashamed!
- We are ashamed!

41:19.400 --> 41:22.040
- We are ashamed!
- We are ashamed!

41:23.360 --> 41:25.880
- We are ashamed!
- We are ashamed!

41:30.160 --> 41:32.560
- We are ashamed!
- We are ashamed!

41:36.000 --> 41:36.880
Zhou Dezhao,

41:36.960 --> 41:37.800
what do you say?

41:37.880 --> 41:38.720
Your Majesty,

41:38.800 --> 41:41.760
since Xue Huaiyuan was wronged,

41:42.400 --> 41:45.360
that means he is not a criminal.

41:45.440 --> 41:48.240
So there's no evidence that Ms. Jiang Li

41:48.320 --> 41:50.040
broke a prisoner out of jail.

41:50.120 --> 41:51.080
That is reasonable.

41:51.160 --> 41:52.120
Jiang Li,

41:52.200 --> 41:53.560
you are acquitted.

41:53.640 --> 41:56.440
You may close your case at
the Court of Judicial Review and go home.

41:56.520 --> 41:58.720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

41:59.280 --> 42:00.160
Rise.

42:00.240 --> 42:02.120
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

42:04.760 --> 42:06.720
Does Xue Huaiyuan have children
and family members?

42:06.800 --> 42:07.800
I want to compensate them.

42:07.880 --> 42:10.480
Xue Huaiyuan had a son and a daughter.

42:10.560 --> 42:11.640
As far as I know,

42:11.720 --> 42:12.920
his son, Xue Zhao,

42:13.000 --> 42:15.720
was killed by bandits
in the capital last year.

42:16.280 --> 42:17.800
His daughter, Xue Fangfei…

42:20.520 --> 42:23.040
was Mr. Shen's late wife.

42:24.480 --> 42:26.760
This is too pitiful.

42:27.480 --> 42:29.080
- Right.
- Yes.

42:29.160 --> 42:30.080
- Yes.
- Right.

42:30.160 --> 42:33.040
- So heartbreaking.
- That's right.

42:40.200 --> 42:43.400
When I found out my father-in-law
had committed corruption,

42:45.360 --> 42:46.360
I was shocked.

42:46.960 --> 42:48.200
Now that I've learned

42:48.280 --> 42:49.800
that he was framed by a villain,

42:49.880 --> 42:51.320
it pains me

42:51.880 --> 42:52.720
now that I recall it.

42:57.520 --> 42:58.440
Father.

42:58.520 --> 42:59.440
Father.

43:00.280 --> 43:01.240
It was tough for you.

43:06.760 --> 43:07.760
Ye Shijie.

43:10.440 --> 43:11.280
Magistrate Xue,

43:12.360 --> 43:13.320
it's all right.

43:13.400 --> 43:14.240
It's fine now.

43:15.680 --> 43:17.400
Magistrate Xue, it's all right.

43:17.480 --> 43:18.400
It's fine now.

43:18.480 --> 43:19.720
Mr. Shen, please forgive him.

43:20.400 --> 43:22.160
You haven't seen Magistrate Xue
for a long time.

43:22.240 --> 43:23.760
I'm afraid he can't recognize you anymore.

43:26.480 --> 43:28.640
Duke Zhou, Magistrate Xue is in shock.

43:29.280 --> 43:30.960
Can I take him back to rest first?

43:35.200 --> 43:36.200
You may leave.

43:42.720 --> 43:44.440
Who wrote this story?

43:48.040 --> 43:48.880
It's really cruel.

43:48.960 --> 43:50.240
What do you mean?

43:50.320 --> 43:51.680
The father is corrupt.

43:51.760 --> 43:53.200
The daughter had an affair.

43:53.280 --> 43:55.120
The son was murdered.

43:55.200 --> 43:57.440
The family of three suffered tragic fates
one after the other.

43:57.520 --> 43:59.280
Isn't this common in storybooks?

43:59.360 --> 44:00.240
What storybook?

44:00.320 --> 44:01.440
Framing

44:01.520 --> 44:02.400
and silencing people.

44:05.480 --> 44:06.880
Framing?

44:06.960 --> 44:08.400
Was Mr. Shen's late wife framed

44:08.480 --> 44:09.920
for having an affair as well?

44:10.000 --> 44:11.040
We can't be sure.

44:11.120 --> 44:12.680
Duke Su has always been bold.

44:12.760 --> 44:14.800
- He dares to say anything.
- Yes.

44:14.880 --> 44:17.000
Duke Su, I'll leave this matter to you.

44:17.560 --> 44:19.560
Investigate the truth
behind the deaths of the Xues

44:19.640 --> 44:21.440
and clear the family's name

44:21.520 --> 44:24.080
so Mr. Shen can feel relieved.

44:25.520 --> 44:26.840
Yes, Your Majesty.

44:30.480 --> 44:31.760
Interesting.

44:38.040 --> 44:40.000
How interesting.

44:41.200 --> 44:43.280
Why didn't Your Majesty ask me to join

44:44.680 --> 44:46.640
such an interesting imperial court trial?

44:47.200 --> 44:49.080
An investigation is not child's play.

44:49.160 --> 44:50.120
Why did you come here?

44:52.800 --> 44:54.840
I have something important
to inform you about.

44:57.840 --> 45:00.520
Ms. Jiang Li has a sharp tongue.

45:00.600 --> 45:03.160
She has successfully overturned
the Xue family's case.

45:03.240 --> 45:05.240
While Your Majesty feels indignant

45:05.320 --> 45:07.160
about your upright subject being framed,

45:07.240 --> 45:08.800
I wonder if you have thought

45:08.880 --> 45:11.240
you were also being played

45:11.320 --> 45:12.440
like a fool?

45:12.920 --> 45:14.000
Wanning,

45:15.280 --> 45:16.480
don't speak nonsense.

45:17.040 --> 45:18.080
What a coincidence.

45:18.560 --> 45:21.600
I heard Mr. Shen's wife

45:21.680 --> 45:23.440
was Huaixiang's most talented lady,

45:24.040 --> 45:27.440
so I got curious and went to take a look.

45:27.520 --> 45:28.680
Indeed.

45:28.760 --> 45:30.880
Mrs. Shen has a unique face.

45:30.960 --> 45:32.880
It was rare indeed.

45:32.960 --> 45:35.160
That's why I was shocked

45:35.720 --> 45:37.360
when I saw Ms. Jiang Li.

45:40.040 --> 45:41.880
Because she looks exactly the same

45:42.680 --> 45:44.360
as Xue Fangfei.

45:45.480 --> 45:47.440
- What?
- Is that so?
